+/* Keep explicit asm names on weakrefs on the same path as ordinary names.
+   Generic assemble_name resolves the stripped identifier, while the weakref
+   mapping can live on its original *name identifier.  Mark the alias, not
+   the ultimate target, so weak_finish still distinguishes weak-only uses
